      "start": 2.071701,
      "end": 5.050794
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Receive a guest with the same attitude you have when alone, and when alone maintain the same attitude you have in receiving guests.",
      "path": "audio/1971-311/03.mp3",
      "start": 6.81229,
      "end": 14.180204
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "In this way the drop drops into the ocean.",
